  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Deathwatch Support",
    "summary": "Each friendly KILL TEAM unit that has this ability gains three abilities: Purgatus Tactics, Furor Tactics and Malleus Tactics. Purgatus Tactics: while it has the assault doctrine active, its attacks against enemy units within 9\" of it have **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)**. Furor Tactics: **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** on the unit's attacks while it has the devastator doctrine active. Malleus Tactics: **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)** on its attacks while it has the tactical doctrine active.\nYour army may include DEATHWATCH units even though their Chapter faction keyword differs from the rest of your army, up to a combined 500 points. Unless a rule says otherwise, no DEATHWATCH model can be picked as your WARLORD when mustering your army. KILL TEAM units can take Enhancements only from this detachment. These are exceptions to the army rules for Space Marine Chapters.",
